{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expansion pack #7 lets you solicit help from <strong>the underground</strong>. The underground is not that concerned with who you are, though\u00a0\u2014 or who this enemy is you keep mentioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This expansion introduces new ways to <strong>interact</strong> with the enemy, has 2 cool new <strong>Units</strong>, and 2 cards that care about things blowing up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dubious</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See? Just some friendly folk with a helping hand. No Questions Asked is a <strong>Tier 1 Event card</strong>, so you can use it right away on the first turn of the game to kick-start your strat! It's basically all upside. Trust me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832990/extras/No_Questions_Asked_S_2.png?t=1750939237\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Radical</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These guys have no pretense of helping you, they're just here to see stuff blow up. Just  point them north on the map and watch the fireworks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832990/extras/Free_Radicals_S.png?t=1750939237\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832990?t=1750939237","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832990?t=1750939237","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832990/25228ea5a54641f5c3ef7de306265f389557973d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750939237","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832990/25228ea5a54641f5c3ef7de306265f389557973d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750939237","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"desc